{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "Self-reflection", "depth": 2, "parent_id": null, "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.85, "confidence_raw": 0.85, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Hi, just been thinking about how my friend did really well in her exams.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 72}, {"session_id": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Last semester, I didn't make the dean's list, which was tough.", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 101}, {"session_id": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "I just wish I could do as well as her.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38}, {"session_id": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "I've been wondering if I just need to focus more or if there's something else going on.", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 101}, {"session_id": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Yeah, I've been wondering if I just need to focus more or if there's something else going on.", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 101}, {"session_id": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "But maybe this time, I can prioritize better.", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 83}, {"session_id": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 21, "quote": "Last year, my friend helped me a lot. I think reaching out might be good this time too.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 87}, {"session_id": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just a lot on my plate.", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 59}, {"session_id": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, just a mix of school and some personal stuff.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 51}, {"session_id": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It’s just a lot right now.", "char_start": 81, "char_end": 107}, {"session_id": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "I feel like I should be doing more to prepare, but I get overwhelmed thinking too much. It's hard to stay focused.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 114}, {"session_id": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "I've tried making schedules, but it just makes me feel more anxious. Maybe I'm just overthinking it.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 100}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261009T005727Z", "last_updated_at": "20261009T010452Z", "first_seen_session": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "last_session": "p000914-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
